<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Augment Systems at $5.50.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Augment Systems at $5.50.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Priced At				     $5.50</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		   $5.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares		    1.8 million</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	  GKN Securities Corp</p>
<p>NOTE:  In addition to the shares, the deal also included 1.8 million warrants which priced at $0.15 per warrant.</p>
<p>Augment Systems Inc, based in Westford, Mass., designs and develops computer server products.</p>
